        "knowledge_point_id": "65bec174-0235-5a32-a0d2-2892af4ddaf9",
        "knowledge_point": "Determining Whether Two Events are Mutually Exclusive",
        "problem": "Given $P(A)=0.25$, $P(B)=0.75$, $P(A\\cup B)=0.8$, determine whether  $A$ and $B$ are mutually exclusive events.",
        "worked_solution": "To check if $A$ and $B$ are mutually exclusive, we must check that $P(A\\cap B)=0.$\n\nWe can calculate $P(A\\cap B)$ using the addition law:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(A\\cup B) & =P(A)+P(B)-P(A\\cap B) \\\\ 0.8 & =0.25+0.75-P(A\\cap B) \\\\ P(A\\cap B) & =0.25+0.75-0.8 \\\\  & =0.2\\ne 0.\\,\\times \\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, $A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events.",
        "answer_fields": [
          {
            "key": "selection",
            "type": "radio",
            "choices_complete": true,
            "choices": [
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "$A$ and $B$ are mutually exclusive events, since $P(A\\cap B)=0$",
                "option": "0",
                "source_option": "a"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "$A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events, since $P(A)\\cdot P(B)\\ne P(A\\cup B)$",
                "option": "1",
                "source_option": "b"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "$A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events, since $P(A\\cap B)\\ne 0$",
                "option": "2",
                "source_option": "c"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "$A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events, since $P(A)\\cdot P(B)<P(A\\cup B)$",
                "option": "3",
                "source_option": "d"
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "value": "$A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events, since $P(A)\\ne P(B)$",
                "option": "4",
                "source_option": "e"
              }
            ],
            "correct_value": "$A$ and $B$ are not mutually exclusive events, since $P(A\\cap B)\\ne 0$",
